### 8.4. Phase 3: Promote Architecture

Promote architecture in this order:

1. invocation kernel;
2. host use cases;
3. provider routing and authority;
4. legacy CLI transition;
5. external provider protocol;
6. Node-to-Rust migration;
7. release boundaries.

